{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026MmwntoMeuM1795045273.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>據報輝達聘用的獵頭公司，已接觸晶片商Arm行政總裁哈斯，但輝達及Arm對報道都不予置評。</p><p></p><p>《彭博》報道，輝達聘用的獵頭公司，已開始接觸不同的合適人選，包括曾於輝達工作的哈斯。</p><p></p><p>現年64歲的哈斯，於2013年才加入Arm，而之前7年一直在輝達任職，擔任副總裁暨運算產品事業總經理。哈斯早前談及黃仁勳離開輝達，他形容這位舊老闆是「一個傳奇」，並指「他在輝達所建立的一切，具有歷史意義。」</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-19T00:43:54.872431+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":191,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-18T23:40:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-19T04:57:12.902270+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-19T00:37:18.006364+00:00","content_hash":"4f2161b66d28e42ecc5c11aaf0b341b9c7d366915db4063994447e97702946b6","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-19T00:43:54.872431+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}